      "intents": [
        "bi-8"
      ],
      "one_line": "After the machine checks, the branch is pushed and one pull request is opened against the branch the change will land on, naming its issue.",
      "doc": "software-delivery-planning/ship-every-change/fn-raise-change/feature.md",
      "identified_by": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fn-673",
      "kind": "feature",
      "mode": "update",
      "one_line": "Once the review approved the change and a person typed yes, it is merged where its branch lands, its branch is deleted, and an issue in a plan is closed with its item set Done."
    },
